{
  "Two delivery targets: a queue, or topic fan-out": "两种投递目标：队列（queue）或主题扇出（topic fan-out）",
  "A producer can send directly to the orders queue. Active, locked and dead_lettered are states inside that same queue; the dead-letter state is not another queue. Receive delivers a locked message to a consumer, while Complete settles it and removes its copy. Alternatively a producer publishes to the events topic, which stores no messages. Matching audit and billing subscriptions each receive an independent copy in their own backing queue, with their own dead-letter state. A nonmatching subscription receives no copy.": "生产者（producer）可将消息直接发送到 orders 队列（queue）。active、locked 和 dead_lettered 都是同一队列内部的消息状态；死信状态（DLQ）并非另一条队列。Receive 将锁定的消息交给消费者（consumer），Complete 则结算并删除该消息副本。另一条路径是向不存储消息的 events 主题（topic）发布。匹配的 audit 和 billing 订阅（subscription）各自在自己的支撑队列（backing queue）中获得独立副本，并拥有各自的死信状态。不匹配的订阅不获得副本。",
